### upload an image through both gateways
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/media/assets?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ContentV2Boundary

--ContentV2Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.svg"
Content-Type: image/svg+xml

< ./fixtures/sample.svg
--ContentV2Boundary--

### list media for the first store
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/media/assets?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}

### prove media listing is store scoped
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/media/assets?store={{STORE_ID_2}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}
